PROJECT: Aptos

## Strategic Objectives
- Tujuan: Menjadi Layer 1 paling scalable dan safe untuk adopsi massal (Mainstream Adoption) melalui teknologi Move VM dan Parallel Execution (Block-STM). | Evidence: Aptos Whitepaper Abstract & Vision; Aptos Labs Blog "Announcing Aptos Mainnet Launch" menekankan "Scalability, Safety, Reliability, Upgradeability" | Sources: Aptos Whitepaper, https://aptoslabs.com/whitepaper.pdf (HIGH); Aptos Blog Mainnet Launch, https://aptoslabs.com/announcing-aptos-mainnet-launch (HIGH)
- Tujuan: Membangun ekosistem Move sebagai alternatif dominan di luar EVM/SVM dengan formal verification dan resource safety. | Evidence: Investasi besar pada Move Language Foundation, Move Prover, Move Analyzer; Phase 4 Technology (Move VM, Move Prover); Phase 7 Developer Ecosystem (SDKs, Grants) | Sources: Move Language Foundation, https://move-language.github.io/move/ (HIGH); Aptos Foundation Grants, https://aptosfoundation.org/grants (HIGH)
- Tujuan: Menarik developer dan institusi enterprise melalui infrastruktur cloud-native (GCP, AWS) dan Account Abstraction native (Keyless). | Evidence: Phase 3 EV-016 (GCP), EV-020 (AWS), EV-022 (Keyless); Phase 7 Infrastructure Providers; Phase 8 Narrative Position (Institutional Infrastructure) | Sources: Google Cloud Blog, https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/web3/google-cloud-blockchain-node-engine-aptos (HIGH); AWS Blog, https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2024/03/amazon-managed-blockchain-aptos/ (HIGH); Aptos Blog Keyless, https://aptoslabs.com/keyless-accounts (HIGH)
- Tujuan: Mendistribusikan token ownership ke komunitas luas (51% allocation) via Foundation untuk mendesentralisasi governance jangka panjang. | Evidence: Phase 6 Token Distribution (Community 51%); Phase 2 Entity (Aptos Foundation); Phase 3 EV-008 (Foundation Launch) | Sources: Aptos Tokenomics, https://aptoslabs.com/aptos-tokenomics (HIGH); Aptos Blog Foundation, https://aptoslabs.com/introducing-the-aptos-foundation (HIGH)

## Decision Timeline
- Decision: Pendirian Aptos Labs & Pengembangan Independent Layer 1 (bukan fork Diem langsung) | Date: 2021-02 | Trigger: Penutupan proyek Diem oleh Meta (Jan 2022); Tim inti Diem (Mo Shaikh, Avery Ching) ingin melanjutkan visi Move VM. | Evidence: Phase 1 Founders; Phase 3 EV-001 (Founding); Phase 2 Founders (Mo Shaikh, Avery Ching) | Immediate Result: Terbentuk Aptos Labs Inc. (Delaware); Rekrutment tim Diem. | Long-term Impact: Kebebasan arsitektur (Block-STM, AptosBFT v4) tanpa constraint korporat Meta. | Related Historical Event ID: EV-001 | Supporting Dataset: Phase 1, Phase 2, Phase 3
- Decision: Fundraising Series A ($200M) & Series B ($150M) dari VC Top-tier sebelum Mainnet | Date: 2022-03-21 (Series A); 2022-07-12 (Series B) | Trigger: Kebutuhan modal besar untuk R&D inti (Rust/Move), ekosistem grant, dan marketing pre-launch. | Evidence: Phase 3 EV-002, EV-005; Phase 5 Funding History | Immediate Result: Treasury $350M; Valuasi $1B -> $4B; Bisa hire agresif & commit grant besar. | Long-term Impact: Tekanan ekpektasi ROI investor; Alokasi token 13.48% ke investor dengan vesting 4 tahun (Cliff Oct 2023). | Related Historical Event ID: EV-002, EV-005 | Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 5
- Decision: Launch Mainnet dengan TGE & Listing CEX Tier-1 Simultaneous (Binance, Coinbase, FTX) | Date: 2022-10-17 | Trigger: Kesiapan teknis (Testnet AIT-1/2/3 selesai); Kebutuhan likuiditas & distribusi token ke pasar. | Evidence: Phase 3 EV-007; Phase 6 TGE; Phase 8 Market Timeline | Immediate Result: Price discovery imediate; Akses retail global; Likuiditas tinggi. | Long-term Impact: Token price volatility tinggi awal; Dependensi pada CEX untuk on-ramp; FTX collapse (EV-010) jadi risiko kontaminasi. | Related Historical Event ID: EV-007 | Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 6, Phase 8
- Decision: Pendirian Aptos Foundation terpisah dari Aptos Labs (Legal Separation) | Date: 2022-10-17 | Trigger: Kebutuhan governance protokol yang credibly neutral; Manajemen treasury komunitas (51%); Kompliance regulasi (Cayman Foundation). | Evidence: Phase 3 EV-008; Phase 2 Entity (Foundation); Phase 6 Governance (Foundation manages Treasury, On-chain Gov manages Params) | Immediate Result: Pemisahan "Company" (Profit R&D) vs "Foundation" (Non-profit Ecosystem). | Long-term Impact: Dual-structure governance complexity; Foundation kontrol treasury besar tapi on-chain gov terbatas param protokol. | Related Historical Event ID: EV-008 | Supporting Dataset: Phase 2, Phase 3, Phase 6
- Decision: Adopsi Block-STM (Parallel Execution) sebagai Core Scaling Tech (bukan Sharding/L2) | Date: 2021 (Design) -> 2022 (Launch) -> 2024 (v2 Upgrade EV-021) | Trigger: Visi "High Throughput Monolithic"; Penelitian internal (Paper Block-STM 2022). | Evidence: Phase 4 System Architecture; Phase 4 Core Components (Block-STM); Phase 3 EV-021 (v1.9/v1.10 Block-STM v2) | Immediate Result: TPS Teoritis >100k (Lab); TPS Mainnet ~2k-5k real. | Long-term Impact: Differentiator teknis vs Solana (SVM) & Monad; Kompleksitas state growth (State Bloat) jadi bottleneck jangka panjang (Phase 4 Known Limitations). | Related Historical Event ID: EV-021 | Supporting Dataset: Phase 4, Phase 3
- Decision: Integrasi Bridge Non-Native (Wormhole, LayerZero) alih-alih IBC Native | Date: 2023-04 (EV-013, EV-014) | Trigger: Kebutuhan likuiditas cross-chain cepat (USDC/ETH dari Ethereum); IBC implementation complex & lambat untuk Move VM. | Evidence: Phase 3 EV-013, EV-014; Phase 7 Major Integrations; Phase 7 Ecosystem Risks (Bridge Dependency) | Immediate Result: Likuiditas Stablecoin & Asset masuk cepat; DeFi TVL naik. | Long-term Impact: Trust assumptions ke Guardian/DVN; Risiko sistemik bridge hack (Wormhole hack history); Menunda IBC Native (Open Thread Phase 7). | Related Historical Event ID: EV-013, EV-014 | Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 7
- Decision: Launch Native Account Abstraction (Keyless Accounts / AIP-62) | Date: 2024-05 (EV-022) | Trigger: Friction onboarding Web2 (Seed phrase); Kompetitor (Abstract, Particle Network, ERC-4337 di EVM). | Evidence: Phase 3 EV-022; Phase 4 Technical Upgrade; Phase 8 Narrative (AA/Keyless) | Immediate Result: Social Login (Google/Apple) live; Sponsored Transactions possible. | Long-term Impact: Potensi user growth massal (Gaming/Social); Kompleksitas keamanan baru (WebAuthn/OIDC reliance). | Related Historical Event ID: EV-022 | Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 4, Phase 8
- Decision: Migrasi Standard Token ke Fungible Asset (FA) / AIP-21/22 | Date: 2024-02 (EV-019) | Trigger: Limitation `0x1::Coin` (Tidak support metadata, royalty, composability DeFi modern). | Evidence: Phase 3 EV-019; Phase 4 Technical Upgrade; Phase 6 Utility (FA Standard) | Immediate Result: DeFi protocols (Thala, Cellana, Amnis) migrasi kontrak. | Long-term Impact: Fragmentasi liquidity saat migrasi; Standar modern untuk RWA/Institutional. | Related Historical Event ID: EV-019 | Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 4, Phase 6

## Evolution Pattern
- Perubahan Strategi: Dari "Diem Successor" (Permissioned/Consortium visi Meta) -> "Permissionless High-Performance L1" (Aptos Labs). | Evidence: Phase 1 Category (Layer 1); Phase 3 EV-001 (Founding context); Phase 4 Consensus (Permissionless PoS vs Diem BFT Authority).
- Perubahan Teknologi: Konsensus DiemBFT -> AptosBFT v4 (Optimizations: Leader rotation, Pipeline); VM Move Interpreter -> JIT Support (Planned); Storage Merkle -> Jellyfish Merkle (Optimized). | Evidence: Phase 4 Consensus Mechanism; Phase 4 Core Components; Phase 3 Technical Upgrades (v1.1, v1.9, v1.11).
- Perubahan Tokenomics: Tidak ada perubahan fundamental post-TGE (Inflation schedule fixed di AIP-1). Hanya aktivasi parameter (Fee Burn live since genesis). | Evidence: Phase 6 Inflation/Deflation; Phase 3 EV-009 (Tokenomics Publish); Phase 6 Governance (AIP-1 params).
- Perubahan Governance: Awalnya Off-chain (Team decide) -> On-chain Governance Framework (AIP Process) live 2023. Foundation tetap hold treasury keys. | Evidence: Phase 6 Governance Model; Phase 7 Governance Ecosystem; Phase 3 EV-008 (Foundation Launch).

## Technical Decision Pattern
- Pola: Memilih Monolithic Architecture dengan Parallel Execution (Block-STM) alih-alih Modular (Rollup/DA Layer). | Mengapa: Visi "Single Global State" untuk composability & UX sederhana; Team expertise (Diem/Block-STM researchers). | Evidence: Phase 4 System Architecture (Monolithic); Phase 4 Core Components (Block-STM); Phase 8 Narrative (Parallel Execution Main Narrative).
- Pola: Menggunakan Move Language (Resource-oriented) sebagai Execution Environment, bukan EVM/WASM. | Mengapa: Safety by design (No Reentrancy, Linear Logic); Formal Verification (Move Prover); Warisan Diem. | Evidence: Phase 4 Execution Environment (Move VM); Phase 4 Programming Languages (Move); Phase 7 External Dependencies (Move Language Foundation - Critical).
- Pola: Konsensus BFT (AptosBFT) dengan Finalitas Instan, bukan Nakamoto/Probabilistic. | Mengapa: User Experience (Finality <1s); Cocok untuk High-Freq Apps (Gaming, Trading); Warisan HotStuff/DiemBFT. | Evidence: Phase 4 Consensus Mechanism (AptosBFT v4, Instant Finality); Phase 8 Competitor Landscape (vs Solana Probabilistic, Ethereum Slots).
- Pola: Upgrade Protokol via On-chain Governance (AIP) + Validator Signaling, bukan Hard Fork Kontroversial. | Mengapa: Upgradeability native Move Framework; Menghindari chain split; Koordinasi validator via stake. | Evidence: Phase 4 Technical Upgrade History (All via Governance); Phase 6 Governance (Proposal System); Phase 3 EV-011, EV-018, EV-019, EV-021, EV-022, EV-024.

## Financial Decision Pattern
- Pola: Large Upfront VC Funding (Equity + Token Warrants) untuk membangun Core Tech sebelum Revenue. | Mengapa: Biaya R&D Rust/Move/Consensus tinggi; butuh tim world-class; Race to market vs Solana/Sui. | Evidence: Phase 5 Funding History ($350M Series A/B); Phase 5 Financial Dependencies (VC Primary); Phase 3 EV-002, EV-005.
- Pola: Zero Protocol Revenue (Fee 100% Burned); Company (Aptos Labs) bergantung Enterprise Revenue & Sisa Treasury VC. | Mengapa: Tokenomics design "Ultrasound Money" narrative (Deflationary pressure); Align validator incentives (Staking Rewards dari Inflasi). | Evidence: Phase 5 Revenue Model (Gas Burned); Phase 6 Inflation/Deflation (Burn Mechanism); Phase 5 Financial Risk (Funding Dependency Aptos Labs).
- Pola: Foundation Treasury Management (51% Supply) untuk Grant Ecosystem (DeFi, Gaming, Infra, Research). | Mengapa: Bootstrap network effect; Kompetisi TVL/Devs dengan chain lain (Arbitrum, Optimism, Solana grants). | Evidence: Phase 5 Treasury (Foundation Allocation); Phase 5 Fundraising Mechanism (Foundation Treasury); Phase 7 Developer Ecosystem (Grant Program); Phase 3 EV-008.
- Pola: Tidak ada Public Sale / IDO / Launchpad; Distribusi via Airdrop (2%) & CEX Listing. | Mengapa: Regulatory clarity (US); Kualitas holder (Institutional/VC aligned); Likuiditas immediate via Binance/Coinbase. | Evidence: Phase 6 Token Sale (No Public Sale); Phase 6 TGE (Launch Platform CEX); Phase 3 EV-007.

## Ecosystem Decision Pattern
- Pola: Integrasi Bridge "Big Two" (Wormhole, LayerZero) Prioritas Utama untuk Liquidity Bootstrapping. | Mengapa: Cepat membawa USDC/ETH/WETH native (via Circle/Tether partnership nanti); Standar industri cross-chain. | Evidence: Phase 3 EV-013, EV-014; Phase 7 Major Integrations; Phase 7 External Dependencies (Bridge - High Criticality).
- Pola: Partnership Cloud Hyperscaler (GCP, AWS) untuk Validator/Node Infra. | Mengapa: Enterprise Grade Reliability; Menarik Institusi/TradFi (Franklin Templeton, Brevan Howard interest); Decentralisasi جغرافي. | Evidence: Phase 3 EV-016, EV-020; Phase 7 Infrastructure Providers (Critical); Phase 8 Narrative (Institutional Infrastructure).
- Pola: Native Stablecoin Partnership (Circle USDC, Tether USDT) bukan hanya Bridged. | Mengapa: Capital Efficiency (No Bridge Risk); Regulatory Compliance (Circle); DeFi Primitif (Lending/Perps butuh stablecoin trust-minimized). | Evidence: Phase 7 Major Integrations (Circle, Tether); Phase 7 External Dependencies (Critical).
- Pola: Hackathon Global Berulang (Aptos Experience, MoveOn, World Tour) dengan Prize Pool >$1M/Tahun. | Mengapa: Developer Acquisition Cost efektif; Membangun "Move Developer Mindshare" vs Rust (Solana) / Solidity (EVM). | Evidence: Phase 3 EV-017, EV-023; Phase 7 Developer Ecosystem (Hackathon); Phase 8 Adoption Metrics (Developer Count).

## Governance Decision Pattern
- Pola: Dual Governance Structure: On-chain Parameter Control (AIP) + Off-chain Legal Treasury Control (Foundation). | Mengapa: Legal compliance (Foundation sebagai legal entity); Kecepatan teknis (On-chain params); Perlindungan Treasury dari Governance Attack. | Evidence: Phase 6 Governance (Model); Phase 7 Governance Ecosystem (Foundation vs DAO); Phase 2 Entity (Foundation vs Labs).
- Pola: Delegated Proof-of-Stake Voting (Validator = Default Voter). | Mengapa: Skalabilitas voting (User tidak perlu vote tiap proposal); Alignment ke Validator (Stake slashing risk). | Evidence: Phase 6 Governance (Voting Power, Delegation); Phase 4 Consensus (Validator Set); Phase 7 Governance Ecosystem (Council = Validator Set).
- Pola: Proposal Technical Originate dari Aptos Labs / Core Contributors (AIP Authors). | Mengapa: Kompleksitas teknis Move VM/Consensus; Labs punya konteks paling dalam; Komunitas review & vote. | Evidence: Phase 7 Governance Ecosystem (Committee: Aptos Labs); Phase 3 Technical Upgrades (Semua EV upgrade dari Labs proposal).

## Risk Response Pattern
- Respon: FTX Collapse (EV-010) -> Transparansi komunitas tentang exposure; Lanjutkan operasi normal; Foundation tidak terpengaruh (Legal Separation). | Evidence: Phase 3 EV-010; Phase 5 Financial Risk (FTX Estate Liquidation); Phase 2 Entity (FTX Ventures Defunct).
- Respon: State Bloat / Hardware Requirements Naik -> Riset Grant "State Expiry / History Expiry"; Optimisasi Block-STM v2 (Memory); Jellyfish Merkle Optimization. | Evidence: Phase 4 Known Limitations (State Bloat); Phase 3 EV-021 (Block-STM v2); Phase 7 Ecosystem Risks (Centralization Risk); Phase 4 Technical Upgrade (v1.9/v1.10).
- Respon: Bridge Hack Risk (Wormhole/LayerZero) -> Diversifikasi Bridge (Celer, Hyperlane planned); Native Stablecoin (USDC/USDT) mengurangi kebutuhan Bridge untuk stablecoin. | Evidence: Phase 7 Ecosystem Risks (Bridge Dependency); Phase 7 Major Integrations (Circle, Tether Native); Phase 7 External Dependencies.
- Respon: Regulatory Uncertainty (US) -> Kompliàn Listing (Coinbase, Kraken); Legal Entity US (Aptos Labs Inc Delaware); Foundation Cayman; Tidak ada Staking Service langsung dari Labs ke US Retail (via Validator Third Party). | Evidence: Phase 2 Entity (Country US); Phase 5 Financial Risk (Regulatory); Phase 8 Market (Kraken Listing US); Phase 6 Token Utility (Staking via Validators).
- Respon: Competitor Sui (Move VM) -> Differenziasi teknis (Account Model vs Object Model; Block-STM vs Mysticeti); Focus Enterprise/Institutional (GCP/AWS); Focus Account Abstraction Native (Keyless). | Evidence: Phase 8 Competitor Landscape (Sui); Phase 8 Narrative Position (AA/Keyless, Institutional); Phase 4 Technology (Block-STM vs Consensus diff).

## Recurring Behavioral Pattern
- Pola: "Research-First Implementation" -> Paper/Academic Research (Block-STM, HotStuff, Move Prover) -> Production Implementation di Mainnet. | Bukti: Phase 4 Tech (Block-STM Paper 2022 -> Mainnet 2022 -> v2 2024); Move Prover (Research -> CI Integration); AptosBFT (DiemBFT Paper -> v4 Mainnet). | Supporting Dataset: Phase 4, Phase 3
- Pola: "Aggressive Infra Partnerships Post-Funding" -> Series A/B Close -> Announce GCP/AWS/NodeReal/Ankr/QuickNode integrations dalam 12-18 bulan. | Bukti: Phase 3 EV-002, EV-005 (Funding) -> Phase 3 EV-016 (GCP Sept 2023), EV-020 (AWS Mar 2024); Phase 7 Infra Providers. | Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 5, Phase 7
- Pola: "Ecosystem Growth via Grants & Hackathons" -> Kuartalan/Half-yearly Hackathon Global + Grant Program Terbuka. | Bukti: Phase 3 EV-017 (2023), EV-023 (2024); Phase 7 Developer Ecosystem (Grant Program, Hackathon); Phase 8 Adoption Metrics (Dev Count naik). | Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 7, Phase 8
- Pola: "Native Standard Upgrade via Governance" -> Identifikasi Limitation (Coin Standard) -> Design New Standard (FA) -> AIP Process -> Deploy -> Ecosystem Migration Support. | Bukti: Phase 3 EV-019 (FA Standard); Phase 4 Technical Upgrade; Phase 6 Utility (FA); Phase 7 Applications (Thala/Cellana migrasi). | Supporting Dataset: Phase 3, Phase 4, Phase 6, Phase 7

## Strategic Trade-offs
- Trade-off: Decentralization (Validator Hardware Cost) vs Scalability (High Throughput Block-STM). | Bukti: Phase 4 Known Limitations (State Bloat, Hardware Req High); Phase 4 Consensus (Permissionless PoS tapi butuh High Spec); Phase 7 Ecosystem Risks (Cloud Centralization). | Evidence Level: HIGH
- Trade-off: Security (Trust-minimized Bridging / IBC) vs Speed to Market (Wormhole/LayerZero Trusted Bridges). | Bukti: Phase 7 External Dependencies (Bridge Critical, IBC Low/Planned); Phase 7 Ecosystem Risks (Bridge Dependency); Phase 3 EV-013, EV-014 (Early Integration). | Evidence Level: HIGH
- Trade-off: Token Distribution Decentralization (51% Community) vs Governance Capture Risk (Foundation Holds Keys, Investor/Team 32% Vesting). | Bukti: Phase 6 Distribution (Foundation 67.5% control initially); Phase 6 Holder Distribution (Whale Concentration High); Phase 7 Ecosystem Risks (Token Concentration). | Evidence Level: HIGH
- Trade-off: Protocol Revenue (Fee Switch) vs Token Burn Narrative (Ultrasound Money / Deflationary Pressure). | Bukti: Phase 5 Revenue Model (Fees Burned 100%); Phase 6 Inflation/Deflation (Burn Live); Phase 5 Financial Risk (Funding Dependency Labs); Phase 6 Open Threads (Fee Switch Discussion). | Evidence Level: HIGH
- Trade-off: Upgradeability (Move Framework Upgradable) vs Immutability/Credible Neutrality. | Bukti: Phase 4 Technology (Framework Upgradable); Phase 3 Technical Upgrades (Frequent v1.x); Phase 6 Governance (On-chain Upgrade Execution). | Evidence Level: MEDIUM

## Behavioral Summary
- Prioritas Utama Proyek: Teknologi Eksekusi Paralel (Block-STM) & Safety (Move VM) sebagai fondasi; Adopsi Massal via Account Abstraction (Keyless) & Enterprise Infra (Cloud); Likuiditas & Distribusi via CEX Tier-1 & Native Stablecoin.
- Cara Mengambil Keputusan: Top-down Technical Leadership (Aptos Labs/Core Contributors) memproposikan AIP -> Review Komunitas/Validator -> On-chain Vote -> Eksekusi. Foundation mengelola Treasury/Grants off-chain. Investor/Team vesting passif.
- Faktor Paling Sering Mempengaruhi Keputusan: 1. Kapabilitas Teknis Tim (Ex-Meta/Diem) -> Memilih Tech Stack (Move, Rust, Block-STM, BFT). 2. Ketersediaan Modal VC Besar ($350M) -> Memungkinkan Hiring Agresif, Grant Besar, Infra Partnership. 3. Kompetisi L1 (Solana, Sui, Ethereum L2) -> Dorongan Differenziasi (Parallel Exec, AA Native, Move Formal Verification). 4. Regulatory Environment (US) -> Struktur Legal Dual (Labs/Foundation), CEX Listing Strategy, No Public Sale.
- Pola Evolusi: Research-Heavy Start -> High-Cap Launch -> Infrastructure Hardening (Cloud, Bridges, Oracles) -> Ecosystem Expansion (Grants, Hackathons, DeFi Standards) -> Consumer Onboarding Focus (Keyless/AA, Gaming SDKs).
- Kekuatan Utama: Tim Inti Berpengalaman Tinggi (Diem); Teknologi Diferensiasi Kuat (Block-STM, Move Safety, Formal Ver); Backing Finansial & Distribusi Kuat (Tier-1 VC, Tier-1 CEX, Cloud Hyperscalers); Standar Bahasa (Move) Shared Ecosystem (Sui, Movement).
- Kelemahan Utama: Sentralisasi Awal Tinggi (Token Concentration, Cloud Validator Dependency); Kompleksitas State Growth (Hardware Barrier); Dependency Bridge Trusted (Belum IBC Native); Zero Protocol Revenue (Burn Model) membebani Company Treasury; Dual Governance Complexity (Foundation vs On-chain).

## Open Threads
- Interpretasi "Decentralization": Apakah Foundation berencana mendelegasikan pengelolaan Treasury ke DAO/On-chain Governance di masa depan? (Tidak ada AIP/resmi roadmap). | Evidence Level: LOW (Spekulasi berbasis pola industri).
- Trade-off Fee Switch: Apakah tekanan finansial Aptos Labs (Company) akan mendorong proposal Fee Switch (Protocol Revenue) yang dikontrakan dengan narasi "Ultrasound Money"? | Evidence Level: MEDIUM (Phase 5 Financial Risk, Phase 6 Open Threads).
- Validator Set Centralization: Apakah peningkatan hardware requirement (State Bloat) akan mendorong keluarnya validator kecil/rumah, meninggalkan hanya Cloud/Institutional? | Evidence Level: MEDIUM (Phase 4 Limitations, Phase 7 Risks).
- Sui Competition: Bagaimana respons strategis jika Sui (Move VM, Object Model) mendominasi niche Gaming/High-Throughput? Apakah Aptos akan pivot ke Institutional/RWA lebih agresif? | Evidence Level: LOW (Analisis Kompetitif, bukan fakta terverifikasi).
- Move Language Governance: Seberapa besar pengaruh Aptos Labs vs Sui/Community di Move Language Foundation terhadap roadmap VM/Compiler yang mempengaruhi Aptos langsung? | Evidence Level: LOW (Phase 7 External Dependencies Critical, tapi detail governance internal Move Lang Foundation tidak transparan publik).